      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for explaining the musical chairs thing, i guess that makes sense. but you mentioned \"guardians\" just now—is that just a metaphor, or is there a specific legal classification for the person holding the money? i just want to be sure i know exactly who is responsible if something goes wrong with the funds.",
